    <string name="closed_title">Components that are not open source</string>
    <string name="closed_intro">Gimano uses three Google services on Android. None of them receives your favourites, places or trips.</string>
    <string name="closed_location">Google Play services location: turns GPS, Wi-Fi and mobile signals into your position on the phone, for the map and navigation.</string>
    <string name="closed_drive">Google sign-in and Drive authorisation: only when you choose Google Drive backup. Drive receives only the backup YOU send to your own Drive.</string>
    <string name="closed_integrity">Play Integrity: when you confirm a nearby place, checks the vote comes from a real phone. Only a pass/fail verdict reaches Gimano.</string>
